This program implements the NAME_4 algorithm in NAME_5 for 5 processes (N = 5). The main steps are:

1. enterCS() - Send REQUEST to all processes and receive ACKs. Enter critical section once ACKs from all processes have been received.

2. sendMessage(i, msg) - Send a message msg to process i.

3. receiveMessage(i) - Receive a message from process i.

4. exitCS() - Send RELEASE to processes that had sent ACK. Reset ACK to 0.

The ACK array keeps track of ACKs received from each process. A process enters its critical section only when it has received ACKs from all processes (indicating they are not in their critical section).

